# `frink/frink.jar`, and custom subset stubs (`cjam.rb`, `glass.rb`, `fish.py`,
# `brain_flak.rb`, `run6502.py`, `runz80.py`) have been removed in favor of
# canonical upstream interpreters/emulators or standalone open-source languages.

